static.text.7=This portal is your starting point for discovering the ideas that shape this world.
static.text.8=Symbol standards, anomalous phenomena, consciousness transfer, biological preservation, nations built around reason or harmony, constructed languages, fictional AI, historical records and art all exist as different layers of the same universe.
