static.text.18=The feel of this world
static.text.19=Part science fiction, part scholarship, part religion, part business, part art: together, they form a shared fictional history.
static.text.20=Ideas at the centre
static.text.21=This world asks not only what we create, but what we protect, what we standardise and what we carry into the future.
static.text.22=Where to begin
static.text.23=Start with the atmosphere of the world, then explore its organisations and nations, and finally follow their connections and history.
